PlexAniListSync.AniListNet
==========================

This project is a vendored, trimmed, and modernized fork of the AniListNet client.

Original work:
  AniListNet - Copyright (c) 2022 Dennise Catolos
  https://github.com/dentolos19/anilistnet  (archived)
  Licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

Derived work / ideas incorporated:
  Kavita.AniListNet - Copyright (c) Kavita
  https://github.com/Kareadita/anilistnet
  Licensed under the MIT License.

Modifications made in this repository:
  - Re-namespaced to PlexAniListSync.AniListNet.
  - Trimmed to only the operations this app uses (media search, media-entry read/save,
    and viewer authentication). Character/Staff/Studio/Review/Trend/Schedule/Recommendation
    operations and their objects were removed.
  - Migrated from Newtonsoft.Json to System.Text.Json.
  - Added a typed AniListRateLimitException thrown on HTTP 429 (Cloudflare's HTML rate-limit
    page previously crashed JSON parsing), with response status read before the body is parsed.
